<Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sheets: Introduction, Field List, then one sheet per structure. Data sheets: rows 1-8 are the header (rows 4-6 hidden: structure, technical field names, type/length; row 7 groups with the key group merged across the key columns; row 8 descriptions, * = mandatory); enter data from row 9.</Data></Cell>
